  "title": "Q.931: fix value-string for Intermediate rate (octet 5b)",
  "description": "According to ITU-T Rec. Q.931 (12/2002), Table 4-6,\nthe Intermediate rate (octet 5b) in the Bearer capability IE is coded as follows:\n\n```\n  7 6\n  ---\n  0 0  Not used\n  0 1  8 kbit/s\n  1 0  16 kbit/s\n  1 1  32 kbit/s\n```\n\nFix incorrect values and add the missing value for `Not used`.",
